WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:03.227
(dramatic music)
(chewing)

00:00:03.227 --> 00:00:04.571
- How long would you say is like,

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:08.765
an appropriate amount of time
before I can go get seconds?

00:00:08.765 --> 00:00:10.413
- I would say like one to two hours.

00:00:10.413 --> 00:00:11.387
- No.

00:00:16.087 --> 00:00:18.531
- Yeah I mean I went to a
wedding a few months ago,

00:00:18.531 --> 00:00:21.701
and I didn't get food
for ever, it was torture.

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:23.465
- Just to be courteous, or?

00:00:23.465 --> 00:00:25.785
- No, I just didn't wanna draw
too much attention to myself.

00:00:25.785 --> 00:00:27.689
I technically wasn't
invited to that wedding.

00:00:27.689 --> 00:00:29.849
- Well I'm hungry, and you know what?

00:00:29.849 --> 00:00:32.289
Alex invited me to have
some of his birthday pizza,

00:00:32.289 --> 00:00:33.845
so I'm gonna have some, alright?

00:00:33.845 --> 00:00:35.072
Yeah, hey Alex!

00:00:35.072 --> 00:00:36.860
- I don't know, one time I
went to this birthday party,

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:38.580
and I didn't get my
hands on a piece of cake

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.692
until pretty much everyone had left.

00:00:40.692 --> 00:00:43.153
And it was off of, you
know, left over plates.

00:00:43.153 --> 00:00:45.998
- Okay, how many people
here even got pizza?

00:00:45.998 --> 00:00:50.027
One, two, three. There's only six slices.

00:00:51.841 --> 00:00:54.185
That's not enough pizza!

00:00:54.185 --> 00:00:56.373
- Just go for it Steven,
you're obviously hungry.

00:00:56.373 --> 00:00:57.431
- Yeah?

00:00:57.431 --> 00:00:59.195
You know what, you're right.

00:00:59.195 --> 00:01:00.843
I shouldn't have to wait to get seconds.

00:01:00.843 --> 00:01:01.458
I'ma get some.

00:01:01.458 --> 00:01:04.387
(screeching)
(intense music)

00:01:04.387 --> 00:01:06.499
Woo, worth it.

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:07.114
- Hey.

00:01:07.114 --> 00:01:08.345
- [Steven] Yo, hey.

00:01:08.345 --> 00:01:09.646
- Do you guys know who ate all the pizza?

00:01:09.646 --> 00:01:11.690
- Mhm, me and a few
other people finished it.

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:12.410
Thanks Alex!

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:13.307
- Dude, why are you thanking him?

00:01:13.307 --> 00:01:14.628
- It's uh, it's his birthday pizza.

00:01:14.628 --> 00:01:16.067
- Dude, his birthday was three months ago.

00:01:16.067 --> 00:01:17.055
That was my pizza.

00:01:17.055 --> 00:01:18.677
(exhaling sharply)

00:01:18.677 --> 00:01:19.979
- Alex, what the heck?

00:01:19.979 --> 00:01:21.890
Let me get you another
pizza, is that okay?

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:22.657
- Sure.

00:01:22.657 --> 00:01:24.256
- Okay.

00:01:24.256 --> 00:01:25.520
- That guy.

00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:26.936
- Right?

00:01:26.936 --> 00:01:29.864
- So I'm going to a bar mitzvah
this weekend, wanna come?

00:01:29.864 --> 00:01:31.390
- Yeah, okay.

